# docs/changelog.md is a list of one-line bullets that branches add to at the same spot (the top of
# "Unreleased"): a union merge keeps both sides' lines instead of stopping on a conflict. A bullet two
# branches both reworded comes out twice, once in each wording; read the section after a merge and keep one.
# Tables (docs/source-map.md, AGENTS.md) are not merged this way: their rows are edited in place as often as
# they are added, and a union would keep a stale copy of each edited row without a word.
docs/changelog.md merge=union
